{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x15---homie-the-clown",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x15 - Homie the Clown",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x15 - Homie the Clown.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:06.265Z",
  "lineCount": 272,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Homie the Clown",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 4711,
      "endMs": 5987
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "When Krusty wants to, he can still blow them away.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 48805,
      "endMs": 51356
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Yes. He can take a simple, everyday thing like eating a bicycle...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 51557,
      "endMs": 54644
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "...and make it funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 54779,
      "endMs": 55919
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "See you tomorrow, kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 56087,
      "endMs": 57564
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "But before I go, I'd just like to say...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 58705,
      "endMs": 62396
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "There's nothing better than a cigarette...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 71087,
      "endMs": 73034
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "...unless it's a cigarette lit with a $ 100 bill.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 73201,
      "endMs": 75651
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Put 5000 bucks on the Lakers. Hire Kenny G to play for me in the elevator.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 76792,
      "endMs": 80248
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "My house is dirty. Buy me a clean one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 80416,
      "endMs": 82732
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Krusty, as your accountant, I must warn you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 82933,
      "endMs": 84980
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Did you send 1000 roses...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 85148,
      "endMs": 86389
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "...to Bea Arthur's grave? - Yes. But she's...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 86557,
      "endMs": 88570
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "I don't wanna hear the end of sentences.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 88738,
      "endMs": 90550
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "George Carlin on three.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 90752,
      "endMs": 91792
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Yeah. Lawsuit? Oh, come on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 91960,
      "endMs": 94644
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "My \"Seven Words You Can't Say on TV\" bit...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 94846,
      "endMs": 96792
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "...was entirely different from your bit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 96960,
      "endMs": 100215
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "So I'm a thief, am I? Well, excuse me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 100483,
      "endMs": 105517
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Give him 10 grand. Steve Martin on four.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 105987,
      "endMs": 107899
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Ten grand.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 108067,
      "endMs": 109678
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Krusty, in regards to the large wager you made on yesterday's horse race...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 109846,
      "endMs": 114309
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Come on. How about letting me go double or nothing on the opera tonight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 114510,
      "endMs": 118000
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Who do you like? The tenor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 118201,
      "endMs": 119711
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Okay. But we're only letting the bet ride...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 120785,
      "endMs": 123168
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "...because you crack us so consistently up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123336,
      "endMs": 126993
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "You've got to stop blowing your money like this, Krusty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 127564,
      "endMs": 130315
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "No can do.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 130550,
      "endMs": 131960
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "And those ridiculous bets you make.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 134007,
      "endMs": 135819
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Gambling is the finest thing a person can do if he's good at it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 136188,
      "endMs": 139342
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "You haven't won anything in months. So I'll just make more money.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 139544,
      "endMs": 142664
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Crank out some merchandise. You already merchandised everything.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 142832,
      "endMs": 146054
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Krusty's Monopoly game, the Krusty Crowd-Control Barrier.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 146188,
      "endMs": 149544
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Nothing is selling anymore. Not even your new Lady Krusty line.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 149745,
      "endMs": 152732
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "But our infomercials are running 24 hours a day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 152899,
      "endMs": 155550
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "So, what do you think of the Lady Krusty Mustache-Removal System, Angelique?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 156993,
      "endMs": 160785
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "It's Krusterrific, Johnny Unitas.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 160953,
      "endMs": 163470
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "But is my upper lip supposed to bleed like this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 163638,
      "endMs": 166255
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Probably.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 166423,
      "endMs": 167497
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "At this rate, you'll be broke in a month. Only thing left to do is...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 167664,
      "endMs": 170886
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "...to open a clown college and train some regional Krustys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 171054,
      "endMs": 173772
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "You mean like that bozo, Bonko the Clown?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 173940,
      "endMs": 176154
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Exactly. Forget it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 176322,
      "endMs": 177933
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "I'll just cut back on the condor-egg omelets.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 178101,
      "endMs": 180416
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "A couple of those would be tasty right now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 181121,
      "endMs": 183235
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "I'll found the college tomorrow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 183436,
      "endMs": 184980
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "It must be the first of the month. New Billboard Day!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 191859,
      "endMs": 195013
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Finders, keepers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 201322,
      "endMs": 203235
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "\"This year, give her English muffins.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 206121,
      "endMs": 208369
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Whatever you say, Mr. Billboard.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 208537,
      "endMs": 210550
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "\"Best in the West.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 215651,
      "endMs": 216960
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "That rhymes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 218067,
      "endMs": 219577
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Clown college. You can't eat that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 222664,
      "endMs": 225685
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "I got everything I was supposed to get.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 227832,
      "endMs": 229577
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "I'm not going to enroll in that clown college, though.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 229745,
      "endMs": 232295
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "That advertisement had no effect on me whatsoever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 232463,
      "endMs": 236087
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Hey, Homer. The section you're supposed to be monitoring is on fire.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 247060,
      "endMs": 250215
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Clowns are funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 259913,
      "endMs": 261725
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Mom? I think I'll have some wine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 272557,
      "endMs": 275409
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Marge? Yes, Homie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 281852,
      "endMs": 284134
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "That's it. You people have stood in my way long enough.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 285980,
      "endMs": 288631
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "I'm going to clown college.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 288832,
      "endMs": 290745
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "I don't think any of us expected him to say that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 292893,
      "endMs": 295309
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "All right. Now, there can only be one Krusty in each territory.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 298292,
      "endMs": 302319
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "So I hope this works out. Tell me where you're from.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 302520,
      "endMs": 305708
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Georgia. Texas.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305909,
      "endMs": 307185
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Brooklyn. Russia.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 308258,
      "endMs": 309970
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "New Hampshire. Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 310171,
      "endMs": 311916
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Okay, we'll start off with the baggy p... Wha...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 312520,
      "endMs": 315372
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Those are supposed to be baggy pants. Baggy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 315574,
      "endMs": 318258
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "I've never had a pair of pants that fit this well in my life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 319500,
      "endMs": 323460
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Okay. Memorize these funny place names: Walla Walla, Keokuk, Cucamonga...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 323661,
      "endMs": 331279
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "...Seattle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 331513,
      "endMs": 333124
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Stop it. You're killing me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 334869,
      "endMs": 336446
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Seattle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 338124,
      "endMs": 339500
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "And now, everybody's favorite, the Spin-Cycle Fantastic trick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 344332,
      "endMs": 348829
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "It's a great piece of buffoonery if you pull it off.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 349030,
      "endMs": 351446
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "But if you blow it, you'll look like a fool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 351614,
      "endMs": 354534
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Steady. Steady.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 357386,
      "endMs": 359735
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Now, when the wealthy dowager comes in, the party's over, right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 362117,
      "endMs": 366044
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Wrong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 366211,
      "endMs": 367487
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "\"Kill wealthy dowager.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 369164,
      "endMs": 370977
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Burn that seat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 378493,
      "endMs": 379768
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "These Krusty-brand balloons are 3 bucks each.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 379970,
      "endMs": 382386
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Get a cheap one, and what happens? Goes off!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 382554,
      "endMs": 385372
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Takes out the eyeballs of every kid in the room. What's that gonna cost you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 385540,
      "endMs": 389265
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Hey, Bill. What did that cost us?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 389500,
      "endMs": 391044
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "I'm sorry I doubted you before, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 412755,
      "endMs": 414970
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "If there has to be a bastardized version of Krusty, I'm glad it's you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 415171,
      "endMs": 418393
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Thanks, honey. Bank shot!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 418594,
      "endMs": 420406
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "That's good aim, Dad. Well, it was my major.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 422480,
      "endMs": 425668
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Welcome to the noble family of skilled Krustaceans.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 425869,
      "endMs": 429393
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "You'll now go back to your hometowns and do kids' parties, swap meets...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 429628,
      "endMs": 434326
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "...and the other piddling crap I wouldn't touch with a 10-foot clown pole.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 434527,
      "endMs": 438789
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Now come and get your catskins...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 438990,
      "endMs": 441272
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "I mean, sheepskins.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 441440,
      "endMs": 442883
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "This is the happiest day of my life...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 448654,
      "endMs": 450970
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Got it. No shock for me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 453218,
      "endMs": 454963
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Oh, yeah?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 455869,
      "endMs": 457312
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "And now, to help introduce our fantastic new burger, the one with ketchup...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 467021,
      "endMs": 471887
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "...here he is, coming in by parachute, Krusty the Clown.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 472089,
      "endMs": 476988
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "\"To audience. I now proclaim this new burger for sale.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 493867,
      "endMs": 500478
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Lord, save me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 510511,
      "endMs": 512089
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "It's the Krusty Burglar.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 516149,
      "endMs": 517894
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Oh, my God. He's stealing all the burgers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 518666,
      "endMs": 520679
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Why, you little...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 521552,
      "endMs": 522827
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Homer. Homer, it's all just an act.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 525478,
      "endMs": 528431
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Stop. Stop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 528632,
      "endMs": 530847
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "He's already dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 531015,
      "endMs": 532995
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Sir. Sir. I gotta get him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 533230,
      "endMs": 534975
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Get him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 535142,
      "endMs": 536417
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Krusty the Clown, everybody.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 537592,
      "endMs": 539370
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Please look at my MedicAlert bracelet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 541954,
      "endMs": 544740
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Hey, hey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 556652,
      "endMs": 557659
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "And then take that and...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 560813,
      "endMs": 562894
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "...put that in there and...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 563464,
      "endMs": 564975
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "...here's your giraffe, little girl. - I'm a boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 566250,
      "endMs": 568800
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "That's the spirit. Never give up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 569001,
      "endMs": 571417
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Well, I guess you're pretty impressed, huh, Bart?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571753,
      "endMs": 574203
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "My dad got Krusty the Clown to personally appear at my party.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 574370,
      "endMs": 578397
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "I have a feeling I could get him to appear at my house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 578565,
      "endMs": 581082
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "I don't know, Bart. My dad's a pretty big wheel down at the cracker factory.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 581585,
      "endMs": 586115
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "It's not 5:30 yet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 594840,
      "endMs": 596686
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Hey, nice threads. I'm beat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 606115,
      "endMs": 609068
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "And after work, I gotta dedicate a new Jiffy Lube and cohost the ACE Awards.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 609236,
      "endMs": 613599
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Wow, Jiffy Lube. Boy, you're running yourself ragged.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 613800,
      "endMs": 617089
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Yeah. When I started this clown thing, I thought it would be nothing but glory.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 617290,
      "endMs": 622458
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "You know, the glory of being a clown.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 622659,
      "endMs": 625277
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "I tell you, it's hard, tiring work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 625545,
      "endMs": 628800
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "But when I see the smiles on their little faces...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 629337,
      "endMs": 632525
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "...I just know they're getting ready to jab me with something.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 632793,
      "endMs": 635981
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Well, my time's almost up here. So I'd like to say I know Woody Allen.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 639568,
      "endMs": 643126
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "And now, the winner for the most promising new series on cable: Old Starsky and Hutch's.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 647018,
      "endMs": 653193
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Accepting the award is the son of the guy who played Huggy Bear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654132,
      "endMs": 657689
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Let's walk and talk. I have wonderful stories about other famous people...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 662924,
      "endMs": 666347
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "...that include me in some way. - Can't. Gotta distract bulls at a rodeo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 666515,
      "endMs": 669904
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Hey, me too. We can go together.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 670072,
      "endMs": 671716
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "No. I'm going a different way than you, Dick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 672186,
      "endMs": 674568
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Your churlish attitude reminds me of the time I had dinner with Groucho and...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 674770,
      "endMs": 678696
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "You're gonna have dinner with Groucho tonight if you don't beat it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 678830,
      "endMs": 680038
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Being a clown sucks. Kicked by kids, bit by dogs, and admired by the elderly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 684199,
      "endMs": 689703
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Who am I clowning? I have no business being a clown.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 689971,
      "endMs": 692958
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "I'm leaving the clowning business to the other clowns in the clowning business.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 693126,
      "endMs": 696783
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Oh, no.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 697454,
      "endMs": 698897
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Well, well, well, velocity boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 699367,
      "endMs": 701582
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "I'm gonna give you the biggest ticket you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 701783,
      "endMs": 703864
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Hey, Krusty!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 704065,
      "endMs": 705575
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "I'm not Krusty. To think I was gonna give you a ticket.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 705743,
      "endMs": 708730
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Krusty the Clown. I am not Krusty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 708897,
      "endMs": 710978
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Hey, Krusty, Krusty. You remember the time we got loaded...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 711179,
      "endMs": 713964
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "...and set those beavers loose in that pine-furniture store?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 714132,
      "endMs": 716884
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Memories. All right, you take it easy, Krusty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 719099,
      "endMs": 721683
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Hey, he didn't give me a ticket.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 724199,
      "endMs": 726347
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "This is an intriguing development.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 726683,
      "endMs": 729300
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "You mean I get 5 percent off everything in the store just because I look like...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 729501,
      "endMs": 733193
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "I mean, just because I am Krusty the Clown?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 733360,
      "endMs": 736179
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "How could I charge full price to the man whose lust for filthy magazines...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 736381,
      "endMs": 739837
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "...kept me in business during that first shaky year?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 740005,
      "endMs": 742421
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Oh, by the way, here is your new issue of Gigantic Asses.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 742589,
      "endMs": 745911
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "I'm telling you, this'll work. They'll think I'm Krusty and give us free stuff.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 746146,
      "endMs": 749770
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "I've been getting free stuff all day. Look at this swell bucket of house paint.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 749971,
      "endMs": 753763
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Look at it. I'm not saying it won't work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 753998,
      "endMs": 755978
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "I'm just saying it's dishonest. If we agree, then why are we arguing?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 756146,
      "endMs": 760005
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Hey, Krusty, hey. Beautiful date tonight, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 761045,
      "endMs": 765810
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "And such lovely children you have now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 766011,
      "endMs": 768394
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "I'm more striking than lovely. You come with me. Come with Luigi.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 768595,
      "endMs": 772320
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "You don't want to sit with the rest of the scum.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 772521,
      "endMs": 775340
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Hey. What's going on?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 775475,
      "endMs": 776783
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "I only consider you scum compared to Krusty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 778151,
      "endMs": 781742
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Well, I can see that. Yeah, you see how you scum.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 781909,
      "endMs": 784661
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Let me get this straight. You took money made franchising your name...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 789292,
      "endMs": 792513
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "...and bet it against the Harlem Globetrotters?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 792681,
      "endMs": 794795
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Oh, I thought the Generals were due.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 794963,
      "endMs": 797614
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "He's spinning the ball on his finger. Just take it. Take the ball.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 799326,
      "endMs": 804728
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "That game was fixed. They were using a freaking ladder, for God's sake.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 806473,
      "endMs": 810634
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "I am afraid the time has come for you to pay us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 811909,
      "endMs": 815399
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Look, I'm cleaned out. Just take the clown college.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 815634,
      "endMs": 818218
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "We have already taken it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 818419,
      "endMs": 819862
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Kids have a lot of money these days.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820064,
      "endMs": 821876
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "So after you finish your performance, you might consider robbing them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 822044,
      "endMs": 825668
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "What can I tell you? You can't get blood from a turnip.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 825903,
      "endMs": 828520
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "You wanna kill me, go ahead and kill me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 828721,
      "endMs": 831641
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Hey, all right, okay already.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 832648,
      "endMs": 834158
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Look, we can talk this over. No more talk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 834326,
      "endMs": 837279
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "It is time for us to take you for a ride.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 837480,
      "endMs": 840433
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Oh, no...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 840634,
      "endMs": 842111
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Mind if I go to the bathroom first? I see no harm in that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 842379,
      "endMs": 846373
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "When he's done in there, I gotta go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 856708,
      "endMs": 858453
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Okay, wherever Krusty's gone, we'll find him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 860846,
      "endMs": 863833
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Legs, you check out the East Side. Louie, Rome and Budapest.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 864001,
      "endMs": 867658
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Tell the boys I want a total world search.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 867826,
      "endMs": 870746
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Right, boss. Right, boss.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 870913,
      "endMs": 872222
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "I want a free car because I'm Krusty. Krusty the Clown. Get it? Krusty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 872424,
      "endMs": 878598
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Cancel the world search.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 881182,
      "endMs": 883095
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "I want everything that's coming to Krusty the Clown, which is me, Krusty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 883766,
      "endMs": 888967
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Hey, it's Krusty, all right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 889638,
      "endMs": 891819
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Should I shoot him gangland-style or execution-style?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 892054,
      "endMs": 895242
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Listen to your heart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 895444,
      "endMs": 897457
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Well, I can't give you the car, Krusty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 898262,
      "endMs": 900041
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "But I can let you have this little number for practically nothing. Only $38,000.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 900209,
      "endMs": 904538
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Hey, what are all these holes?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 906148,
      "endMs": 907726
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Speed holes. They make the car go faster.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 907893,
      "endMs": 909739
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Oh, yeah. Speed holes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 909907,
      "endMs": 912491
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "You want my advice? I think you should buy this car.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 915309,
      "endMs": 917994
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "We need more ammo. Let's go to Big 5.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 919168,
      "endMs": 921249
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Krusty, your plastic surgery is complete. Now, when I remove the bandages...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 923397,
      "endMs": 927726
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "...don't be alarmed by the total stranger staring back at you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 927960,
      "endMs": 931115
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "I look exactly the same, you moron!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 934638,
      "endMs": 937122
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Oh, nonsense, Krusty. You look at least 10 years younger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 937289,
      "endMs": 940075
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Plus, I did your breasts. Hear me complaining about the breasts?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 940242,
      "endMs": 943598
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Oh, what's the use in hiding?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 943799,
      "endMs": 945611
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "I gotta go back to Springfield and face the music.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 945779,
      "endMs": 948195
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Can you loan me bus fare?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 948397,
      "endMs": 949806
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 950578,
      "endMs": 951853
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "What you diddily doing, neighbor?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 956652,
      "endMs": 958430
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "I'm putting speed holes in my car. Makes it go faster.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 958598,
      "endMs": 961685
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Is that so? Well, gee, maybe the old Flanders-mobile could use...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961887,
      "endMs": 965309
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Wow, lucky I always keep a Bible close to my heart...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 968895,
      "endMs": 972116
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Lucky I was wearing this extra-large piece of the true cross today.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 975606,
      "endMs": 979801
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "I think I'll go inside.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980338,
      "endMs": 981747
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "What keeps doing that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 983861,
      "endMs": 985438
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "I told you we should've bought more than three bullets. Let's just grab him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985640,
      "endMs": 989297
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 989801,
      "endMs": 991109
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "But wait. You can't kill me for being Krusty. I'm not him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 993089,
      "endMs": 996109
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "I'm Homer Simpson. The same Homer Simpson who...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 996311,
      "endMs": 998693
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "...crashed his car through the wall of our club?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 998861,
      "endMs": 1001109
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Actually, my name is Barney. Yeah, Barney Gumble.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1001512,
      "endMs": 1003995
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "The same Barney Gumble who keeps taking pictures of my sister?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1004163,
      "endMs": 1007385
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "Actually, my real name is...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1007586,
      "endMs": 1009264
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Think, Krusty, think. Joe Valachi.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1009734,
      "endMs": 1011579
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Same Joe Valachi who squealed to the Senate committee about organized crime?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1011781,
      "endMs": 1015405
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Benedict Arnold. The same Benedict Arnold...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1015606,
      "endMs": 1017687
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "...who plotted to surrender West Point to the hated British?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1017854,
      "endMs": 1020640
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "I am so glad I had a chance to meet you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1023995,
      "endMs": 1027720
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "...before we did this, Krusty, because I am a great fan.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1027922,
      "endMs": 1032385
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Don Vittorio Dimaggio.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1032922,
      "endMs": 1034968
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Krusty the Clown.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1035136,
      "endMs": 1036781
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Sorry I have to do this, Krusty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1037351,
      "endMs": 1039801
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "I cannot do it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1042653,
      "endMs": 1044700
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "To murder a funnyman of such genius would be a crime.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1044935,
      "endMs": 1049834
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Tell you what, Krusty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050606,
      "endMs": 1052217
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Do for me my favorite trick, where you ride the little bike through the loop...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1052385,
      "endMs": 1056713
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "...and I will let you live. - But I've never been able to do the...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1056881,
      "endMs": 1060438
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "Hey, how about if I squirt you in the face with my boutonni�re? Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1060707,
      "endMs": 1064096
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "I'll never be able to do this trick. Never. - Go. Go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1065807,
      "endMs": 1069398
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Hey. I'm doing it. I'm doing it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1072049,
      "endMs": 1074767
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "I'm the greatest clown in the world.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1074968,
      "endMs": 1077250
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "The fact that you did not do the trick well is the biggest insult of all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1085942,
      "endMs": 1091378
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Hey, guys. I came to...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1092083,
      "endMs": 1093425
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Oh, you got a deadly game of cat and mouse going. I'll come back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1094935,
      "endMs": 1097989
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "I'm seeing double here. Four Krustys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1099297,
      "endMs": 1101781
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Krusty. Oh, thanks. Thanks a lot. You came here to save me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1101982,
      "endMs": 1106613
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "Yeah. That's what I did.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1106814,
      "endMs": 1109230
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "My apologies to you. I almost made a grievous error.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1109432,
      "endMs": 1114364
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "Goodbye, Krusty. Wait.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1114532,
      "endMs": 1117083
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "He can't kill anybody if he doesn't know which one's the real Krusty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1117284,
      "endMs": 1120908
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "I am confused.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1124767,
      "endMs": 1126177
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Good one, Krusty. Oh, crap.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1127183,
      "endMs": 1130002
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Because of that disrespectful display...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1130203,
      "endMs": 1132989
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "...I shall now kill both of you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1133156,
      "endMs": 1135270
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "Unless you both go through the loop together.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1136579,
      "endMs": 1140908
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "I can't see, you idiot. Take your hands off my eyes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1149935,
      "endMs": 1152922
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Hey. Not bad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1170371,
      "endMs": 1172183
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Without the loop, it is nothing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1172720,
      "endMs": 1174465
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Yeah, Krustys!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1189432,
      "endMs": 1191579
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Grazie. Grazie. You have brought great joy to this old Italian stereotype.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1194289,
      "endMs": 1200027
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "No, no, Don Vittorio. You're not... Yes, I am. I know it. I am.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1200262,
      "endMs": 1203987
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "Anyway, thank you, Krusty. Oh, you're welcome.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1204188,
      "endMs": 1207812
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "So we're even now, huh? No, we just won't kill you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1208013,
      "endMs": 1211738
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "But you still owe us the money.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1211940,
      "endMs": 1213852
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Forty-eight dollars. Here's 50.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1214624,
      "endMs": 1217242
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "And 2, your change. And we thank you. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1217443,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 6,
    "episode": 15
  }
}
